// die_emb_H1M2.flp -- EMBEDDED TIER, below the glass microchannel cavity.
// Config H1M2: 2 Mono3D stack(s) + HyFlexPIM chiplet.
// Embedded power 430.04 W over 696.14 mm^2. Top tier adds 405.27 W.
// Mono3D stack = ONE block at 144.67 W / 121 mm^2 = 119.6 W/cm^2 (102 W DRAM +
//   42.67 W NMP logic lumped; the hybrid-bonded pair measured isothermal to
//   0.22 K in the dual-plate runs, so resolving the two tiers buys nothing here).
// HyFlexPIM blocks are hfp_chiplet_duty.flp VERBATIM, translated to (1000, 7200):
//   140.70 W duty-weighted, 6 analog strips at 190 W/cm^2, unrotated so the coolant
//   still flows +y with the PU rows in series, as in the validated chiplet.
// Slot order is fixed across configs (S0, S1, S2, S3) so N is the only variable.
// Slots are y-symmetric about 15900: S0/S2 vs S1/S3 is a controlled upstream/
//   downstream pair. No powered block sits under the top-tier Mono3D column.
// Generated by gen_embedded.py -- regenerate, do not hand-edit.

